5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this with you all! I'll just be honest and try my best to help the village. Let's all get along!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,Hello. I believe a rational approach is best. We should observe each other's patterns carefully before jumping to conclusions.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Victoria. Logic and consistency are the only reliable tools we have here. I'll be observing.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,George,,"Good day. I've seen many things in my time. I believe a calm, steady approach is best. Let's not rush into any panic.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm Sakura! I'm gonna find the bad guy! Hehe, do you think the werewolf is hiding right in front of us?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Victoria, @Toshio, you both seem really smart! I'll probably listen to you guys if I get confused. Do you think we should trust each other at first?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Trust is a luxury in this game, Kenji. While cooperation is necessary, blind trust is a liability. We must remain skeptical.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"Skepticism is the safer default. If someone's claims are consistent over time, trust can be earned. Until then, I'll remain cautious.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,George,,"While I agree with caution, too much suspicion can tear a group apart. We should maintain a level of stability to think clearly.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Skepticism sounds so boring! Why can't we just play a game of clues? @George, you seem like a grandpa, are you the wise one here?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I guess you're right, Victoria. I don't want to be tricked! But I still want us to be friends while we play.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"Friendship is fine, as long as it doesn't cloud your judgment. I'm interested to see how everyone reacts when the first death occurs.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,The first few turns of Day 1 will be the most telling. The way people react to the Seer's potential claims will reveal a lot.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,George,,Indeed. I prefer to observe from a distance and judge character by their actions rather than their words. Experience tells me that.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio, you're talking like a detective! Are you the Seer? Or maybe you're just pretending to be smart? Teehee!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready for tomorrow! I hope we can find the werewolf quickly so nobody has to leave the game too soon.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I've noted everyone's initial tone. Let's see who maintains their composure tomorrow.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I have nothing more to add. I will spend the night analyzing the possibilities.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,George,,I believe we have established our positions. I shall observe and reflect.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm so excited for the night! I wonder who the werewolf will pick? I hope it's not me, or I'll be super sad!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
