33,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Good morning! Oh man, I hope everyone is okay. Does anyone have any clues yet? @Victoria, what do you think?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is too early to make definitive claims. However, I am watching for any sudden shifts in behavior or contradictions in logic.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I'm looking for discrepancies. If anyone claims a role, I'll be checking if their subsequent actions align with that role's goals.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,George,,Let us remain calm. There is no need for hasty accusations this early. We should listen to everyone first.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Good morning everyone! Did you all sleep well? @Kenji, you're so worried! Are you nervous because you're the werewolf?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"What?! No way, Sakura! I'm just a regular guy! I really want to help the village. I'm not the werewolf!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Sakura's accusation is playful, but Kenji's reaction is quite emotional. It's a typical response, but worth noting.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, your approach is chaotic. While it can provoke reactions, it doesn't provide logical evidence. Let's focus on the facts.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,George,,"Sakura is just being spirited. Let's not mistake youth for guilt. However, Kenji, try to keep your composure.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, I just wanted to see his face! But wait, @Toshio is being so serious... it's almost suspicious, don't you think?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll try to be calmer! I just really don't want you guys to think I'm the bad guy. I trust you all!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, you've been very consistent in your desire for logic. Is there anyone you find particularly suspicious right now?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Not yet. However, the Possessed often tries to blend in by agreeing with the majority or the most trusted person. I'm watching for that.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,George,,I find the current atmosphere acceptable. No one has made a claim that is blatantly contradictory yet. Let's be patient.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, you're asking so many questions! Are you trying to lead us somewhere? Maybe you're the one hiding something!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Kenji,,This is harder than I thought! I don't know who to believe. I'll trust Victoria and Toshio since they seem to have a plan.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I have a clear picture of the current dynamics. I believe we have enough to make a preliminary decision, though it is a risk.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I still see no overwhelming evidence. However, if we must vote, I will choose the person whose behavior is most erratic.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,George,,"I believe we should avoid a mistake today. If we execute an innocent villager, we only help the werewolf. I'll vote carefully.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Everyone is so serious! I think it's fun to guess! I'm gonna vote for the person who seems the most ""boring"" because they're hiding a secret!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
